text:
The immediate-adjacency constraints force two blocks: Ben–Elif–Gus in three consecutive slots, and Dev–Ann in two. Ivo is two slots before Cara and must sit after Ann, so Dev can only be in slot 5 and Ben–Elif–Gus only in slots 2–4. Finn then has to take slot 1, which leaves Ivo, Hana, and Cara in slots 7–9.

